ces where  people have given her things and  she's gone out of her way to share those  those items  even some of the items that were gifts  that were sent to her from  you guys she was sharing them one of the  girls didn't she only had one pair of  shoes in the treatment center  and so she gave her a pair of shoes or  she was giving clothes to people that  didn't have  so she's definitely just  her true character has completely come  out  in all of this and she feels so blessed  that she wants to share that with other  people so  i think that that's been it's been the  most wonderful thing to work with her  and one of the most incredible things  has been how many letters she's  received she shared with me on multiple  occasions that's  that that's one of her biggest  motivators and  because there's been so many people that  have said that they're going to  treatment because of amanda  because they've seen her transform her  life  amanda and i decided to do a video a day  in the life  of so what it's actually like to go to  treatment for a day  because i also get a tremendous amount  of people reaching out saying that  they're  scared to go to treatment or they don't  want to feel like they're in jail they  can't do what they want to do  um so we did that together and i can  link that on my instagram  if anyone wants to see it but but yeah  that was really really incredible  and she definitely took charge and  explained  what goes on but i think at this point  she feels like a staff member because  she's been there for a while  so she finishes everybody's sentences  before they  when they're explaining a therapy or a  technique  yeah so in a nutshell the reason  amanda's  rehab has been so successful  is why because she was re  removed from a traumatic environment  for a sustained period of time so all of  a sudden  you take someone who all the life that  they know  i'm i'm not good enough for this this is  where i  am and um she couldn't imagine  what her life could